  ('GRAIN', 'Ruth 2:12', 'May the LORD repay you for what you have done. May you be richly rewarded by the LORD, the God of Israel.', NOW()),
  ('GRANT', 'Romans 15:5', 'May the God who gives endurance and encouragement give you the same attitude of mind toward each other that Christ Jesus had.', NOW()),
