  ('JEWEL', 'Proverbs 20:15', 'Gold there is, and rubies in abundance, but lips that speak knowledge are a rare jewel.', NOW()),
  ('JOINS', 'Matthew 19:6', 'So they are no longer two, but one flesh. Therefore what God has joined together, let no one separate.', NOW()),
  ('JOYFUL', 'Psalm 100:1', 'Shout for joy to the LORD, all the earth. Worship the LORD with gladness.', NOW()),
  ('JUST', 'Isaiah 45:21', 'There is no God apart from me, a righteous God and a Savior; there is none but me.', NOW()),
  ('JUSTLY', 'Micah 6:8', 'He has shown you, O mortal, what is good. And what does the LORD require of you? To act justly and to love mercy and to walk humbly with your God.', NOW()),
  ('KNEEL', 'Psalm 95:6', 'Come, let us bow down in worship, let us kneel before the LORD our Maker.', NOW()),
  ('LAMBS', 'John 21:15', 'When they had finished eating, Jesus said to Simon Peter, Simon son of John, do you love me more than these? Yes, Lord, he said, you know that I love you. Jesus said, Feed my lambs.', NOW()),
  ('LIGHT', 'Matthew 5:14', 'You are the light of the world. A town built on a hill cannot be hidden.', NOW()),
  ('LIMBS', 'John 15:5', 'I am the vine; you are the branches. If you remain in me and I in you, you will bear much fruit.', NOW()),
